Prose this package writes for its own users - the tour (`first-session.md`), the how-tos
(`how-to-*.md`), the tool's reference (`tool-reference.md`) and the explanation of one call
(`what-a-call-does.md`) - and the one machine-readable surface: `eyg-surface.tsv`, one builtin row per name and one effect row per name with the
policy field that decides it, generated and drift-checked by `bin/agent/gen-surface.mjs`.
The language's prose is not copied here; it is at <https://eyg.run/guides>.
